   "what_failed": "Detecting substantial shifts in offensive shot mix based on opponent lineup changes (e.g., absence of a rim big).",
   "why": "Sub-1pp mix shifts with PPP t=+1.1; chat verdict WEAK/SMALL, will not carry a paper. Rim share +0.123 with SE 0.295. (Limited by small_sample / SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER)."
