 "evidence_establishes": [
  "Confounding by player-level tendencies (shooter-level confound) and team quality is a significant risk when attempting to isolate personnel effects on play types or shot selection.",
  "Lineup fixed effects are crucial for adequately controlling for player-level confounders when studying play-type or shot selection effects.",
