   "code": "SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER",
   "text": "The effect of changing one or two players in a lineup on overall shot mix might be small, as suggested by prior work (FAM:SF34). While the dataset is large, specific lineup combinations might have limited minutes played, potentially leading to underpowered tests for granular effects."
